  "prefLabel": "He-P 830.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2020-06-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 830.02 Scope. This part shall apply to any individual, agency, partnership, corporation, government entity, association, or other legal entity operating a psychiatric residential treatment program, except:\n\n(a) All facilities listed in RSA 151:2, II(a)-(i); and\n\n(b) All entities that are owned or operated by the state of New Hampshire, pursuant to RSA 151:2, II(h).\n\nSource. #6154, eff 12-29-95, EXPIRED: 12-29-03\n\nNew. #10059, eff 12-23-11; ss by #12952, INTERIM, eff 12-21-19, EXPIRED: 6-18-20\n\nNew. #13195, eff 4-24-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p800.html"
